  "title": "Ruth's Red Lentil and Potato Soup",
  "description": "I made up this lentil potato soup recipe one chilly weeknight to stave off a cold. I was surprised at how delicious the soup was! A warm loaf of sourdough bread is all you need to complete your meal!",
  "authors": [
